	<section_number>38.2-4005</section_number>
	<catch_line>License may be renewed annually</catch_line>
	<text>
		Each license to a burial society shall expire on the June 30 next occurring after its effective date and may be renewed by the Commission annually.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 38-146; 1952, c. 317, § 38.1-556; 1978, c. 4; 1986, c. 562.</history>
</law>
